      en: ["The Wadi Jizan Dam has a capacity of about 51 million cubic meters.", "Jazan is considered Saudi Arabia's 'pantry' for tropical fruits.", "The wadi receives significant rainfall during the summer monsoon.", "The region is home to over 30 different varieties of mango.", "The wadi system supports a unique microclimate in the southwest.", "Archaeological sites prove farming in this wadi since ancient times."],
