      en: ["The 1256 eruption lasted for 52 days.", "It contains the spectacular Al-Wahba crater (though often attributed to Kishb).", "Harrat Rahat is composed of alkali olivine basalts.", "The southern part is located closer to the city of Jeddah.", "It is part of a massive volcanic arc parallel to the Red Sea.", "Scientists use InSAR technology to monitor ground deformations."],
